      "text": "③ createBrandLogoUpload  (actions/brands.ts)\n• requireAdmin()  (_utils/require-admin.ts)\n• logoUploadSchema: contentType + size\n• key = tmp/brands/<uuid>.<ext>\n• createPresignedPut(key, type)  (lib/storage.ts)\n  signs Content-Type + Cache-Control, expires 5 min\n→ returns { key, url }",
      "originalText": "③ createBrandLogoUpload  (actions/brands.ts)\n• requireAdmin()  (_utils/require-admin.ts)\n• logoUploadSchema: contentType + size\n• key = tmp/brands/<uuid>.<ext>\n• createPresignedPut(key, type)  (lib/storage.ts)\n  signs Content-Type + Cache-Control, expires 5 min\n→ returns { key, url }",
