      "text": "⑦ createBrand / updateBrand  (actions/brands.ts)\n• requireAdmin() + createBrandSchema / updateBrandSchema\n• promoteLogo(tmpKey):\n   verifyUploadedImage  (_utils/verify-upload.ts)\n     HeadObject → size > 0 and ≤ 2 MB\n     read first 16 bytes → sniff real image type\n     invalid → deleteObjects + error to client\n   moveObject(tmp/brands/x → brands/x)",
      "originalText": "⑦ createBrand / updateBrand  (actions/brands.ts)\n• requireAdmin() + createBrandSchema / updateBrandSchema\n• promoteLogo(tmpKey):\n   verifyUploadedImage  (_utils/verify-upload.ts)\n     HeadObject → size > 0 and ≤ 2 MB\n     read first 16 bytes → sniff real image type\n     invalid → deleteObjects + error to client\n   moveObject(tmp/brands/x → brands/x)",
