      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• requireAdmin() + addWatchImagesSchema (1–4 unique keys)\n• watch missing → delete the tmp files, fail\n• promoteImages(watchId, keys):\n   verifyUploadedImage: real size + magic bytes\n   moveObject → watches/<watchId>/<uuid>.<ext>\n   all or nothing: one bad file → every file removed",
