      "text": "STATE  watches · brands · pendingIds · imageBusyIds · synced\nREFS   —\nSYNC   during render: data changed → watches = mergeServerWatches(...);\n       brands changed → brands = server brands\nRETURNS data, watches, brands, setBrands, patchWatch, removeWatch,\n        pendingIds/setPending, imageBusyIds/setImageBusy",
      "originalText": "STATE  watches · brands · pendingIds · imageBusyIds · synced\nREFS   —\nSYNC   during render: data changed → watches = mergeServerWatches(...);\n       brands changed → brands = server brands\nRETURNS data, watches, brands, setBrands, patchWatch, removeWatch,\n        pendingIds/setPending, imageBusyIds/setImageBusy",
