      "text": "STATE  fileInput (via callback ref) · uploadTarget\nREFS   none on purpose: the compiler lint forbids passing refs\n       out of a hook that is read during render\nCALLS  createWatchImageUpload (via uploadWatchImage) · addWatchImages\n       reorderWatchImages · deleteWatchImage\nRETURNS setFileInput, pick, onFilesPicked, setCover, deleteTarget,\n        remove (run.image)",
      "originalText": "STATE  fileInput (via callback ref) · uploadTarget\nREFS   none on purpose: the compiler lint forbids passing refs\n       out of a hook that is read during render\nCALLS  createWatchImageUpload (via uploadWatchImage) · addWatchImages\n       reorderWatchImages · deleteWatchImage\nRETURNS setFileInput, pick, onFilesPicked, setCover, deleteTarget,\n        remove (run.image)",
