      "text": "STATE  drawerOpen · dialog { open, state } · saving · freshId\nREFS   selectInWatchDrawer: callback from the watch drawer that\n       selects a newly created brand in its form\nCALLS  createBrandLogoUpload (via uploadBrandLogo) · createBrand\n       updateBrand · deleteBrand\nRETURNS drawerOpen, setDrawerOpen, dialog, saving, freshId, openNew,\n        openEdit, onDialogOpenChange, save, remove (run.brand)",
